      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "307",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在春汛时，某城市有淹没的危险. 苏联军队的战士们赶",
        "来抢险，他们炸开了壅塞的流水. 此后第一天，水位变",
        "化了 $-1.2$ 米，第二天变化了 $-0.7$ 米. 河流水位在这两",
        "天内是怎样变化的？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "308",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作以点 $M(-3,-3)$ 为圆心、以 4 个单位为半径的圆",
        "周. 把这个圆周先向上平移 5 个单位，以后再向右平移",
        "3 个单位."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "309",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "按递增顺序排列下列各数：9，$-40$，$-15$，0，1，$-7$，7，",
        "$-9$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "310",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "按递减顺序排列以下各数：$-25$，$-30$，29，$-5$，4，$-2$，",
        "1，0."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "311",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知 $x$ 与 $y$ 为正数，而且 $x\\ne y$. 用 $<$，$>$ 或 $=$ 号代替星",
        "号，使成为真等式或真不等式：",
        "1) $0*x$；　　　2) $-y*0$；　　　3) $-x*y$；",
        "4) $y*-x$；　　　5) $|x|*-x$；　　　6) $|y|*y$；",
        "7) $-x*|y|$；8) $|-x|*|-y|$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "312",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1950 年苏联有工程师 40 万人，美国有工程师 31 万人.",
        "到 1973 年，苏联的工程师人数增加到 $690\\%$，而美国",
        "增加到 $225\\%$. 1973 年苏联的工程师人数比美国多",
        "多少？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "313",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解方程：",
        "1) $235.46-(2.3a+1.2a)=227.06$；",
        "2) $171.84-(3.8x-1.3x)=167.34$."
      ]
    },
